# Hex EVM private key (no 0x prefix needed; ethers accepts both forms) for an
# INJ wallet that will send 0.001 INJ to fresh wallets so they can pay gas for
# their first AuthZ grant. If unset, the faucet is a no-op — brand-new wallets
# will fail their first grant with "account not found" and have to fund
# themselves manually.
#
# Anything mainnet works. The wallet only ever sends 0.001 INJ per fresh user
# (with a 60s per-address cooldown), so a small float is enough.
FAUCET_PRIVATE_KEY=

# Optional. Production listen port for server.js. Defaults to 36000.
# PORT=36000

# Optional. Dev API port for dev-server.js. Defaults to 36001.
# API_PORT=36001
